{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start your journey by picking up a mysterious Immortal Ring \u2014 and travel freely between two worlds!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cTale of Immortal Ring\u201d is a top-down cultivation game that blends intense bullet-hell combat with relaxing incremental progression.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a realm overrun by demons and spirits, you will wield your sword and face countless enemies \u2014 each with unique forms and powers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge through waves of deadly projectiles, strike back with precision, and cut down hordes of monsters in dazzling battles.With every stage you clear, you\u2019ll earn abundant spirit stones and rare materials to fuel your path toward immortality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Tale of the Immortal Ring: Prologue&quot; delivers a complete, standalone introduction to your immortal journey! Experience meticulously polished core gameplay, featuring unique level designs, a diverse growth system, and a wide array of distinctive enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And this is only the beginning \u2014 the full version will evolve significantly with more levels, deeper progression, and fiercer enemies, offering the definitive, fast-paced path to immortality!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>01. Ultimate Convenience</strong><br>Designed for one-handed play with 1\u20132 minute rounds, perfect for quick, fun, and satisfying gaming sessions on the go.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137490/extras/97b72f5d9974da594f19261bb28aa317.poster.avif?t=1762329526\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137490/extras/97b72f5d9974da594f19261bb28aa317.webm?t=1762329526\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137490/extras/97b72f5d9974da594f19261bb28aa317.mp4?t=1762329526\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>02. Well-Crafted Progression</strong><br>Blends relaxed incremental growth with finely tuned game balance, delivering constant motivation and a solid sense of achievement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137490/extras/18fa589cf37d322820b1897ce045c155.poster.avif?t=1762329526\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137490/extras/18fa589cf37d322820b1897ce045c155.webm?t=1762329526\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137490/extras/18fa589cf37d322820b1897ce045c155.mp4?t=1762329526\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>03. Rich &amp; Varied Content</strong><br>The demo includes 2 uniquely themed maps, 12 handcrafted stages, and over 20 types of monsters with distinct looks and abilities (approx. 60 mins of playtime).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137490/extras/86a2cdc1ce70a6a3ff6663c607dd12ee.poster.avif?t=1762329526\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137490/extras/86a2cdc1ce70a6a3ff6663c607dd12ee.webm?t=1762329526\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137490/extras/86a2cdc1ce70a6a3ff6663c607dd12ee.mp4?t=1762329526\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>04. Deep Customization</strong><br>A diverse skill tree lets you unlock new abilities, boost resource gains, and enhance character stats \u2014 tailor your own path to power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137490/extras/f6ce42bcd5d7220a355a06a5da330123.poster.avif?t=1762329526\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137490/extras/f6ce42bcd5d7220a355a06a5da330123.webm?t=1762329526\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137490/extras/f6ce42bcd5d7220a355a06a5da330123.mp4?t=1762329526\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>05. Exciting Random Equipment</strong><br>Randomized equipment drops keep every run fresh and full of surprises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137490/extras/cdc0d5793420f01468688102ec404046.poster.avif?t=1762329526\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137490/extras/cdc0d5793420f01468688102ec404046.webm?t=1762329526\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137490/extras/cdc0d5793420f01468688102ec404046.mp4?t=1762329526\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>06. Authentic Immortal Fantasy</strong><br>Experience the classic cultivation journey \u2014 from Qi Refining to Transcending Tribulation (demo progress currently caps at Foundation Establishment completion).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137490/extras/48d6d16899ea77442a520f8739858eb6.poster.avif?t=1762329526\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137490/extras/48d6d16899ea77442a520f8739858eb6.webm?t=1762329526\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137490/extras/48d6d16899ea77442a520f8739858eb6.mp4?t=1762329526\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4137490?t=1762329526","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137490/c3446438fe91e0075fecc0f36f108f761fc2f478/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762329526","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137490/dd62678dc6b5c79215faf0b471512fd0aef3b3b8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762329526","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137490/dd62678dc6b5c79215faf0b471512fd0aef3b3b8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762329526","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start your journey by picking up a mysterious Immortal Ring \u2014 and travel freely between two worlds!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cTale of Immortal Ring\u201d is a top-down cultivation game that blends intense bullet-hell combat with relaxing incremental progression.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a realm overrun by demons and spirits, you will wield your sword and face countless enemies \u2014 each with unique forms and powers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge through waves of deadly projectiles, strike back with precision, and cut down hordes of monsters in dazzling battles.With every stage you clear, you\u2019ll earn abundant spirit stones and rare materials to fuel your path toward immortality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Tale of the Immortal Ring: Prologue&quot; delivers a complete, standalone introduction to your immortal journey! Experience meticulously polished core gameplay, featuring unique level designs, a diverse growth system, and a wide array of distinctive enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And this is only the beginning \u2014 the full version will evolve significantly with more levels, deeper progression, and fiercer enemies, offering the definitive, fast-paced path to immortality!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>01. Ultimate Convenience</strong><br>Designed for one-handed play with 1\u20132 minute rounds, perfect for quick, fun, and satisfying gaming sessions on the go.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137490/extras/97b72f5d9974da594f19261bb28aa317.poster.avif?t=1762329526\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137490/extras/97b72f5d9974da594f19261bb28aa317.webm?t=1762329526\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137490/extras/97b72f5d9974da594f19261bb28aa317.mp4?t=1762329526\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>02. Well-Crafted Progression</strong><br>Blends relaxed incremental growth with finely tuned game balance, delivering constant motivation and a solid sense of achievement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137490/extras/18fa589cf37d322820b1897ce045c155.poster.avif?t=1762329526\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137490/extras/18fa589cf37d322820b1897ce045c155.webm?t=1762329526\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137490/extras/18fa589cf37d322820b1897ce045c155.mp4?t=1762329526\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>03. Rich &amp; Varied Content</strong><br>The demo includes 2 uniquely themed maps, 12 handcrafted stages, and over 20 types of monsters with distinct looks and abilities (approx. 60 mins of playtime).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137490/extras/86a2cdc1ce70a6a3ff6663c607dd12ee.poster.avif?t=1762329526\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137490/extras/86a2cdc1ce70a6a3ff6663c607dd12ee.webm?t=1762329526\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137490/extras/86a2cdc1ce70a6a3ff6663c607dd12ee.mp4?t=1762329526\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>04. Deep Customization</strong><br>A diverse skill tree lets you unlock new abilities, boost resource gains, and enhance character stats \u2014 tailor your own path to power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop p